{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57198","headline":"十四科头 善恶不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 善恶不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我自身心快乐，翛然无善无恶。\n法身自在无方，触目无非正觉。\n六尘本来空寂，凡夫妄生执着。\n湼盘生死太平，四海阿谁厚薄？\n无爲大道自然，不用将心画度。\n故菩萨散诞灵通，所作常含妙觉。\n声闻执法坐禅，如蚕吐丝自缚。\n法性本来圆明，病愈何须执药。\n了知诸法平等，翛然清虚快乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}